{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國人氣男團Seventeen隊長S.COUPS昨晚單拖襲港，吸引大批港迷捱夜接機，他今日上午現身尖沙咀的商場，出席代言行李箱品牌的快閃活動，吸引數百粉絲逼爆商場各層，場面相當墟冚，當中更有不少粉絲通宵排隊霸位。</p><p>S.COUPS甫現身，全場即</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T04:03:50.832086+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T03:56:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T03:57:12.659170+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T03:57:12.659170+00:00","content_hash":"83f91e8fa92a6be414ae9342acb0926e95784c6c01a8009aa569f0130f056c99","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}